TrueOps AppSec third-party notices
=================================

TrueOps AppSec includes upstream Caddy, its standard modules, other pinned Go
dependencies and the Go runtime. These components retain their respective
copyrights, licenses and notices. The root LICENSE applies to TrueOps AppSec's
own code and does not replace third-party license terms.

Release archives include a licenses/ directory containing the upstream license
and notice files copied from the exact dependency versions used for that target,
plus the Go toolchain's LICENSE. The release packaging step appends a versioned
dependency index below, with paths to those files. The build manifest records
the toolchain, upstream Caddy version and module inventory.
